  - line: 12
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_focus: Days after the trade market, all slaves are summoned to the surface as a vast Galactic Federation war fleet arrives, issuing an ultimatum to the Anunnaki to evacuate the planet by dawn."
  - line: 13
